{"post": true, "caption": "Hesitation feels like caution. But skipping a planned trade is a decision too, and it has a cost.\nYou never know in advance which trade in your plan will be the winner. Skip a few and the math can flip.\nIf you freeze at the entry, your size is probably too big. Shrink the risk until a loss feels boring, then follow the plan.\nBe honest: have you ever frozen on a perfect setup? Yes or no.\n\nEducation only. Not financial advice.\n\n#CandleAndCode #TradingPsychology #TradingMindset #TradingForBeginners #RiskManagement", "tag": "MINDSET", "footer": "Education only. Not financial advice.", "bpm": 92, "scenes": [{"type": "hook", "dur": 2.4, "size": 120, "lines": [{"t": "PERFECT SETUP.", "c": "green"}, {"t": "YOU FROZE.", "c": "red"}]}, {"type": "text", "dur": 3.0, "size": 84, "lines": [{"t": "Price hits your level.", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "Your finger hovers.", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "\"What if I'm wrong?\"", "c": "red"}]}, {"type": "text", "dur": 3.0, "size": 88, "lines": [{"t": "Then it runs", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "without you.", "c": "red"}, {"t": "Sound familiar?", "c": "muted"}]}, {"type": "bars", "dur": 5.5, "title": "Same plan, 10 trades", "subtitle": "example: 4 wins of $200, 6 losses of $100", "rows": [{"l": "Took all 10", "v": 200, "vl": "+$200", "lc": "fg", "bc": "green"}, {"l": "Skipped 1 winner", "v": 1, "vl": "$0", "lc": "fg", "bc": "muted"}, {"l": "Skipped 2 winners", "v": 200, "vl": "-$200", "lc": "fg", "bc": "red"}]}, {"type": "text", "dur": 3.0, "size": 84, "lines": [{"t": "You never know", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "which trade wins.", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "Skipping is a bet too.", "c": "red"}]}, {"type": "text", "dur": 3.2, "size": 88, "lines": [{"t": "Can't click buy?", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "Your size is", "c": "green"}, {"t": "too big.", "c": "green"}]}, {"type": "text", "dur": 2.8, "size": 84, "lines": [{"t": "Risk an amount", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "you can lose calmly.", "c": "green"}]}, {"type": "end", "dur": 2.2, "line": "Trade with a system, not a feeling."}]}